  "text": "On the authority of Abu Abd-Arhman Abdullah, the son of Umah Ibn-Akhatab, may Allah be pleased of them both, who said, I heard the messenger of Allah, made a blessings and peace of Allah be upon him. Say, Islam has been built on five pillars, testifying that there is no God but Allah, and that Muhammad is the messenger of Allah, performing the prayers, pain as a cut, making the pilgrimage to the house and fasting and Ramadan. It was related by Abu Khari and Muslim.",
